    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`on_deck_run_id PK, custody_id FK, final_inventory_decision_digest, state(ready|offloading|blocked|committed), created_at_ms, terminal_at_ms, target_reserved_at_ms NULL`",
      "constraints": "只允许Handoff B Accepted transaction与immutable Final Inventory Decision同事务首次建立；同一Custody一个non-terminal Run；`blocked`在自动预算未耗尽时可恢复，耗尽后是零资源且投影为`attention_required`的稳定业务暂停态，只有显式用户Retry可把同一Run恢复为`offloading`；只有`committed`为terminal且写`terminal_at_ms`；`target_reserved_at_ms`只在Arca同事务重验Final Decision目标无其他未Commit持有者后、首次进入offloading时写入，blocked保留；未取得预约的blocked不得阻塞其他Run，恢复须重新竞争；committed后预约失效但保留历史时间；Supporting Work通过Foundation反向关联；`INDEX(state,created_at_ms)`"
